<title>UK: IPAI issues first quarter alumina output data.</title>
<headline>IPAI issues first quarter alumina output data.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>World production of alumina  in first quarter 1997 was 10.557 million tonnes against 10.155 million in fourth quarter 1996 and 10.200 million in the year ago quarter.</p>
<p>The International Primary Aluminium Institute's data included a note pointing that first quarter 1997 alumina data for the first time included Kazakhstan and the Federal Republic of Yugoslavia (Montenegro).</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
